  '遠足は|とっての|大人に|とって': { order: [2, 1, 3, 4], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 1, translation: 'For a small child, a school outing is as exciting as an overseas trip is for an adult.' },
  'ないが|わけでも|許さない|なら': { order: [4, 3, 2, 1], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 2, translation: 'If you are sincerely sorry, it is not that I will refuse to forgive you, but I want a proper apology.' },
  '考え|思い切って|末|抜いた': { order: [1, 4, 3, 2], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 3, translation: 'After thinking it through for three days, I decided to take the plunge and quit the company.' },
  '思い出そう|何だっ|と|たっけ': { order: [2, 4, 3, 1], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 4, translation: 'No matter how hard I try to recall the singer\'s name, I just cannot remember it.' },
  '会社に|入ってくる|会社の|たび': { order: [1, 2, 4, 3], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 2, translation: 'Every time a new employee enters the company, we must teach them the company\'s rules.' },
  '待たされて|加えて|次々と|長い時間': { order: [2, 4, 1, 3], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 4, translation: 'In addition to this intense heat, people collapsed one after another after being made to wait for a long time.' },
  'も|が|逃げように|逃げ道': { order: [3, 1, 4, 2], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 1, translation: 'There was a bear in front of me and a valley behind me, so even if I wanted to escape there was no escape path, and I hurriedly climbed a tree.' },
  '間違い|名前|だらけで|だけが': { order: [1, 3, 2, 4], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 2, translation: 'The kanji in this essay is full of mistakes, and only the name is written with correct kanji.' },
  'と|から|言っても|必ずしも': { order: [2, 1, 3, 4], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 3, translation: 'Nowadays is an era where even if you graduated from college, it doesn\'t necessarily mean you can get a job.' },
  '子どもがいる|生活が苦しくなる|からこそ|というけれど': { order: [2, 4, 1, 3], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 4, translation: 'People say that having many children makes life tough, but precisely because I have children, I find the strength to work hard.' },
  '助け合いの気持ちが|なるにつれ|豊かに|薄く': { order: [3, 2, 1, 4], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 2, translation: 'As society becomes more affluent, the spirit of mutual help has grown weaker.' },
  'とともに|ときは|とき|きれいだったが': { order: [2, 4, 3, 1], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 3, translation: 'This house was also beautiful when it was built, but with the passage of time, repairs have become necessary in various places.' },
  '普通のカレー|いっても|じゃなくて|と': { order: [4, 2, 1, 3], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 2, translation: 'A: What\'s for dinner today? B: Curry. Although I say curry, it\'s not ordinary curry but Indian style.' },
  'ほか|より|ない|借りる': { order: [4, 2, 1, 3], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 1, translation: 'If you don\'t have enough money, you probably have no other choice but to borrow from your parents.' },
  'された|どんなに|反対|ところで': { order: [2, 3, 1, 4], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 1, translation: 'No matter how strongly I am opposed, I intend to marry her.' },
