  'かわって|副社長が|会社経営|社長に': { order: [4, 1, 2, 3], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 1, translation: 'It was decided that the vice president would manage company operations in place of the hospitalized president.' },
  '少なくは|ものだって|非常識に|なってしまった': { order: [3, 4, 2, 1], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 2, translation: 'A: \'This is what society considers common sense.\' B: \'Cases where what was common sense ten years ago has now become absurd are by no means few.\'' },
