  '新製品を|もとに|作る|して': { order: [2, 4, 1, 3], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 4, translation: 'A meeting was held to create new products based on customers\' feedback.' },
  'めぐって|兄弟が|あげく|はげしく争った': { order: [1, 2, 4, 3], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 4, translation: 'After fiercely disputing over their parents\' inheritance, the siblings ended up parting ways in bitter conflict.' },
  '料理をしなくていい|好きな|だけでなく|ということ': { order: [2, 3, 1, 4], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 1, translation: 'The reason why many housewives love traveling is not only that they enjoy seeing rare scenery, but also that they don\'t have to cook.' },
  '待たされた|診察はすぐ|あげくに|さんざん': { order: [4, 1, 3, 2], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 3, translation: 'Feeling unwell, I went to the hospital, but after being kept waiting terribly long, the examination was over in an instant, and I was told, \'It\'s just a cold.\'' },
