  '既卒かを|新卒か|問わず|採用試験を': { order: [2, 1, 3, 4], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 1, translation: 'At this company, anyone can take the employment exam regardless of whether they are a new graduate or already graduated.' },
  '実行されるのに|試してみる|少数の学校で|先立ち': { order: [1, 4, 3, 2], starSlot: 2, starChoice: 4, translation: 'Prior to the new educational method being implemented, it was decided to test it at a small number of schools.' },
  'あるまいが|道に迷う|一応|ことなど': { order: [2, 4, 1, 3], starSlot: 3, starChoice: 1, translation: 'Although it is unlikely that a veteran guide of Kimura\'s caliber would lose his way, let\'s call the police just in case.' },
